      en: ["The fort was constructed between 1804 and 1806.", "It is located approximately 10 kilometers southwest of Port-au-Prince.", "The fort was a key element in the defense line against France.", "The structure features several underground water cisterns.", "It was built using rubble stone and lime mortar.", "From this vantage point, the Gulf of Gonaïves is visible."],
