      hu: ["Az erődöt 1745 körül fejezték be a Cul-de-Sac síkság biztosítására.", "Olyan ágyúütegekkel volt felszerelve, amelyek akár 12 fontos ágyúkat is hordoztak.", "1794-ben az erőd heves ellenállást tanúsított a brit csapatokkal szemben.", "A falazat részben fosszilis koralltömbökből áll.", "A függetlenségi háborúk idején a csapatok kórházaként szolgált.", "A létesítmény körülbelül 15 kilométerre északnyugatra található Port-au-Prince-től."],
      ro: ["Fortul a fost finalizat în jurul anului 1745 pentru securizarea câmpiei Cul-de-Sac.", "Era dotat cu baterii care purtau tunuri de până la 12 livre.", "În 1794, fortul a opus o rezistență acerbă trupelor britanice.", "Zidăria constă parțial din blocuri de corali fosili.", "A servit ca spital de campanie pentru trupe în timpul războaielor de independență.", "Instalația se află la aproximativ 15 kilometri nord-vest de Port-au-Prince."],
      en: ["The fort was completed around 1745 to secure the Cul-de-Sac plain.", "It was equipped with batteries carrying up to 12-pounder cannons.", "In 1794, the fort offered fierce resistance to British troops.", "The masonry consists partly of fossilized coral blocks.", "It served as a military hospital during the wars of independence.", "The facility is located about 15 kilometers northwest of Port-au-Prince."],
